---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';
import FabiApp from '@/components/FabiApp.tsx';
---
<Layout
  title="Fabian Murauer – Software Developer"
  description="Fabian Murauer (Red_Wolf2467) – Software developer, founder of Avocloud.net."
  canonical="https://avocloud.net/fabi"
  schema={false}
>
  <FabiApp client:load>

      <!-- About -->
      <section class="section" id="about">
        <div class="wrap">
          <div class="section-label">ABOUT ME</div>
          <div class="grid cols-2">
            <div>
              <h2 class="headline" style="font-size:1.75rem;margin-bottom:1.25rem;">Hi, I'm Fabian.</h2>
              <p style="color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.7;">
                I'm a software developer from Wels, Austria with around five years of experience -
                what started as tinkering around quickly grew into a real passion. I love building
                things that actually get used and working on the kind of diverse projects that keep
                things interesting.
              </p>
              <p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;">
                As the founder of Avocloud.net, I lead a small team that transforms creative ideas into
                reality. What started as a hobby has evolved into a collaborative platform where we
                experiment with software development, Discord bot creation, and various tech projects.
                My role covers full-stack development, server administration, network technology,
                and project leadership.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 style="font-family:var(--font-brand);font-weight:600;font-size:1.05rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.6rem;">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--coral)" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:20px;height:20px;flex-shrink:0;">
                  <polyline points="4 17 10 11 4 5"/><line x1="12" y1="19" x2="20" y2="19"/>
                </svg>
                Tech Philosophy
              </h3>
              <p style="color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:1.5rem;line-height:1.7;">
                I'm a passionate Linux user - my main PC runs Linux exclusively (sorry Microsoft!).
                I believe in self-hosting and maintaining control over my digital environment. From my
                own private cloud infrastructure to self-hosted password managers and even my own VPN -
                I prefer running everything on my own servers rather than relying on third-party providers.
              </p>
              <h3 style="font-family:var(--font-brand);font-weight:600;font-size:1.05rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.6rem;">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--coral)" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:20px;height:20px;flex-shrink:0;">
                  <path d="M22 10v6M2 10l10-5 10 5-10 5z"/><path d="M6 12v5c3 3 9 3 12 0v-5"/>
                </svg>
                Education
              </h3>
              <p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;">
                Currently attending <strong>HTL Traun</strong>, where my curriculum covers
                Medientechnik, network engineering, IT security, and database systems.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Journey / timeline -->
      <section class="section" id="timeline">
        <div class="wrap">
          <div class="section-label">JOURNEY</div>
          <h2 class="headline" style="font-size:1.75rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">My Journey</h2>
          <div class="card">
            <span class="mk tl"></span><span class="mk br"></span>
            <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.5rem;">
              <div>
                <div style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.68rem;letter-spacing:0.15em;color:var(--coral);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:0.2rem;">2026</div>
                <div style="font-family:var(--font-brand);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:0.25rem;">Paramedic Training · Red Cross</div>
                <p style="margin:0;">Completing Sanitäter training with the Austrian Red Cross. Theoretical exam scheduled for late May 2026 - practical hours to follow.</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.68rem;letter-spacing:0.15em;color:var(--coral);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:0.2rem;">2025</div>
                <div style="font-family:var(--font-brand);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:0.25rem;">EduGrade &amp; QrGate · JRK Helfer</div>
                <p style="margin:0;">EduGrade released as an open-source Docker app for grade management. QrGate successfully deployed in production for Helenenbühne Sattledt events. Stepped up as helper/leader (Betreuer) at Jugendrotkreuz.</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.68rem;letter-spacing:0.15em;color:var(--coral);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:0.2rem;">2024</div>
                <div style="font-family:var(--font-brand);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:0.25rem;">Avocloud.net Launch</div>
                <p style="margin:0;">Officially launched Avocloud.net as a collaborative platform for open-source tools and infrastructure.</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.68rem;letter-spacing:0.15em;color:var(--coral);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:0.2rem;">2023</div>
                <div style="font-family:var(--font-brand);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:0.25rem;">HTL Traun · Baxi Verified</div>
                <p style="margin:0;">Started at HTL Traun (Medientechnik), covering network engineering, IT security, and database systems. Baxi became a verified Discord bot used in thousands of servers.</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.68rem;letter-spacing:0.15em;color:var(--coral);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:0.2rem;">2022</div>
                <div style="font-family:var(--font-brand);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:0.25rem;">Helenenbühne Sattledt</div>
                <p style="margin:0;">Took over full technical operations for the local theater group - sound, lighting, video production, and web infrastructure including email servers.</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.68rem;letter-spacing:0.15em;color:var(--coral);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:0.2rem;">2020</div>
                <div style="font-family:var(--font-brand);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:0.25rem;">First Lines of Code</div>
                <p style="margin:0;">Started programming with Python. What began as tinkering and curiosity quickly grew into a daily passion for building things that get used.</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.68rem;letter-spacing:0.15em;color:var(--coral);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:0.2rem;">2019</div>
                <div style="font-family:var(--font-brand);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:0.25rem;">Joined JRK as Kid</div>
                <p style="margin:0;">Joined the Austrian Youth Red Cross (Jugendrotkreuz) as a kid member.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Skills -->
      <section class="section" id="skills">
        <div class="wrap">
          <div class="section-label">SKILLS</div>
          <h2 class="headline" style="font-size:1.75rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">My Skills</h2>
          <div class="grid cols-3">
            <div class="card">
              <span class="mk tl"></span><span class="mk br"></span>
              <h3>
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"/><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"/></svg>
